      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Predominant antiferromagnetic Cu/Gd coupling with a large low-T moment. Magnetization reaches 88.8 NμB at 7 T (2–10 K), close to 90 NμB expected for 6 CuII + 12 GdIII. Large magnetocaloric effect: −ΔSm ≈ 33.7 J kg−1 K−1 at 3 K, identifying 1 as a molecular magnetic refrigerant candidate.",
